 "storyArc": "Tomás finally reads all of Rosa's letters to Joaquín, never sent. By 1978 the siblings had bought the building together with their parents' savings; Joaquín had borrowed money he could not repay and wanted to sell; Rosa refused, they fought, and he left that night. Hernando tells them what Rosa had told him years later: that she had written to him every year and never had the courage to post a single letter.",
